# f7 = tally. x is proven a whole number and comes raw, the bound of the counter is an int32. The front end expects an int32 of what operators on bits alone take, and the typed copy of the loop
# proved that in front of itself or went into the closed copy: 4,000,000,000 ran every turn closed. The operator cuts any number to an int32 without running code, and what comes
